00:09:47.795 --> 00:09:53.005
if I make a mirror image of that,
well, what exactly does that mean?

00:09:53.015 --> 00:09:54.645
And is this something that's chiral?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.030
or achiral.

00:09:56.490 --> 00:10:00.740
Now, when we are looking at both
these, right, we can try to analyze

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:05.589
these different models and we can
try to compare them to each other.

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:09.379
Can we make them as mirror images, right?

00:10:09.589 --> 00:10:13.489
So, the whole idea is that let's say if
