00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.290
hey, do I have the exact same structure?

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:14.460
So here I have both of
these different molecules.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.989
So I have the one that we had
on the left hand side, right?

00:12:17.989 --> 00:12:20.939
I have the OH kind of
pointing, uh, towards you guys.

