00:13:14.655 --> 00:13:19.095
So these are referring to that they
are enantiomers of one another, right?

00:13:19.435 --> 00:13:21.205
So these are mirrors.

00:13:21.535 --> 00:13:25.595
So now when it comes to a mirror,
one thing that you want to try to

00:13:25.605 --> 00:13:32.244
